---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ProtoDashboard from "../components/ProtoDashboard";
import StatusCard from "../components/StatusCard";
---
<BaseLayout title="V100 32G · FastLLM 推理记录">
  <header class="home-hero">
    <p class="home-kicker">V100 32G / FastLLM field notes</p>
    <h1>一座仓库，完整保留推理实践。</h1>
    <p class="home-deck">
      从 Qwen3.5、Qwen3.6 到 Qwen3.8：性能数据、生产架构、故障定位与运维决策，
      按原始文件结构组织成可搜索、可逐篇阅读的知识库。
    </p>
    <div class="home-links">
      <a class="home-link-primary" href="/v100-perfs/repo">浏览整个仓库</a>
      <a class="home-link-secondary" href="/v100-perfs/docs/getting-started">快速开始</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <ProtoDashboard client:load />

  <div class="status-section">
    <StatusCard client:visible />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
